+### Concrete unresolved direct-draw teaching ambiguity
+
+`workspace/teaching_probe.py` is a reusable, source-pinned diagnostic. Its fixed
+budget declares seeds 0..31 and three natural rival interpretations before
+search: reverse composition, interpret code 7 as counterclockwise rotation,
+and interpret code 8 as identity. For each seed it freezes every rival's fit
+on default samples 0..2 before generating/inspecting samples 3..6 as queries.
+It stops at its first retained disagreement; seeds 0..6 were actually screened.
+
+Seed 6 has three valid, distinct demonstrations containing no command 7.
+The `code7_counterclockwise` rival therefore fits all three demonstrations.
+Query index 2 (sample index 5) has column commands [7, 6] and row commands
+[7, 2], and distinguishes the rival from the canonical duplicate-transpose
+meaning of 7. The other three queries agree. All seven inputs pass the
+production self-check and are distinct. This is an explicit ambiguity of this
+three-demo direct-draw lesson; it is not a wrong canonical output or a native
+export qualification failure.
+
+The final protected Racket replay executes both exact programs on all seven
+inputs: 14 calls, all three demo equalities confirmed, and query index 2
+confirmed unequal. Both protected outputs also match the independent Python
+models. Exact inputs, both outputs, complete programs, source/program/probe
+hashes and protected runtime identity are retained in
+`WORK/checks/e1ec4585ab53/teaching-probe.json`; sibling `canonical.rkt` and
+`rival.rkt` make the programs directly reusable. The wrapper receipt is
+`teaching-probe-verified-command.json`, with matching verified log.
+
+The four original Catalog training pairs were read and independently checked:
+the Python canonical model matches all four, while each of the three rivals
+is rejected by at least one original demonstration. That comparison was a
+Python screen, not an additional protected replay. The generated failure
+therefore concerns missing command coverage in a small random lesson.
