+
+The actual canonical expression is
+`(transform-code (transform-code src rcmd) ccmd)`: row command first, then
+column command. The module opening docstring agrees. Its `SUMMARY` constant
+and the inherited task `SUMMARY.md` had the order reversed. This review
+corrects task `SUMMARY.md` only and records that the production constant still
+needs a coordinated future correction. Composition is observable: the reverse
+order fails original training examples 0, 1 and 3 in the independent screen.
